    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様、愛依",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010030,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "って、プロデューサー！？\r\nわー！　お疲れ～っ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010040,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "え、てか見てたの？　ちょっとハズいんですけど！\r\n声くらいかけて～",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真剣にレッスンしてたからな\r\nすごい迫力だったぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010050,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "トーゼン！　うち、『アイドル』だかんね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010060,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "まだまだ全然だし、あさひちゃんや冬優子ちゃんと\r\nユニットすんだから頑張んなきゃだし──",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010070,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ちゃんとレッスンしなきゃ、\r\n見てくれてるトレーナーさんに悪いっしょ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010080,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "それにプロデューサーにも！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、俺に……か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "もちろん！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010100,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "プロデューサーに言われてアイドル始めてさ、\r\nうちっぽくないんじゃないかなーとか思うこともあったけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010110,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "でも、最近はさ、友達とかに『愛依じゃないみたい！』\r\nみたく言われるの、ちょー気持ちよくなってきたんだよね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010120,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "だって、今のうち、\r\nちゃんと『アイドル』っぽくやれてるってことじゃん？",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010130,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "プロデューサーにはさ、\r\nマジ、マジ感謝してるんだよ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900201/1019002010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019002010140,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "プロデューサーにスカウトされなかったら、\r\nうち、ずーっと毎日テキトーに生きてた気がするし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
